==History==
2023
*The Super Magic Archer [[Cards|card]] was made available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Super Magic Archer Challenge]] on 13/2/2023.
*On 20/2/2023, the Super Magic Archer was removed from the game.
*On 10/4/2023, the Super Magic Archer was readded to the game in the Super Cards Triple Draft Event.
*On 18/4/2023, the Super Magic Archer was removed from the game.
2024
*On 19/8/2024, the Super Magic Archer was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 26/8/2024, the Super Magic Archer was removed from the game.
2025
*On 27/1/2025, the Super Magic Archer was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 3/2/2025, the Super Magic Archer was removed from the game.

==Trivia==
*The word “Archer” comes from the Latin “''arcus”'', meaning bow. The practice of archery was first developed in Africa by the later Middle Stone Age (approx. 70,000 years ago). It is documented as part of warfare and hunting from the classical period until the late medieval period when it was made obsolete by the increased use of firearms.
**The bow that Super Magic Archer uses in [[Basics of Battle|battle]] is a magical [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Recurve_bow recurve bow].
**In the Persian language setting of the game, the Super Magic Archer's name translates to "Super Magic Shooter".
**The Super Magic Archer is 1 of 10 [[cards]] associated with archery, with the others being [[Archers]], [[Arrows]], [[Tower Princess]], [[X-Bow]], [[Princess]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Super Archers]], [[Archer Queen]], and the [[Little Prince]].
*The Super Magic Archer's stats are the highest or lowest among all [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]]. More specifically:
**The Super Magic Archer has the lowest damage of all troops, with 1 damage at Levels 9 and 15.
**The Super Magic Archer is tied with [[Electro Giant]] for the lowest first attack speed of all troops, with a first attack speed of 1.5 seconds.
**Among all troops with area damage, the Super Magic Archer is tied with Magic Archer and Super Archers for the smallest area damage radius of all troops, with a radius of 0.25 tiles.
*When deployed, the Super Magic Archer will say "''好的 (Hǎo de)''"'','' and when attacking, often says “''爆炸 (Bàozhà)''” which mean "''Ok''" and ''“Explode''“ in Chinese.
**The Super Magic Archer is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Mega Minion]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Dark Prince]], [[Bowler]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Electro Wizard]], Princess, [[Ice Wizard]], Magic Archer, [[Lumberjack]], [[Mother Witch]], [[Fisherman]], [[Goblin Machine]], [[Super Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Boss Bandit]], Archer Queen, Little Prince, and the [[Terry]].
*Hypnotized [[Princess Towers|Crown Towers]] will change their Tower Skin to the one of the user that hypnotized them.
*Hypnotized troops or Crown Towers will have hearts coming out of them to signal they have been turned. The [[King's Tower]] will show this effect if it gets hit by a Super Magic Archer's attack, but will not actually be hypnotized.

